      "resolvable": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 681210898,
          "type": null,
          "body": "I can't reproduce this on macOS 11.5.2 with Xcode 12.5.1, CMake 3.19.7, and ninja 1.10.2, using `cmake -G Ninja -DENABLE_SMI=OFF`, if I undo this change in my build tree.\n\n1. On what version of what OS are you doing this?\n1. Are you doing it from the command line or in some IDE?\n1. For what generator is CMake generating build files?\n1. What is the build error?",
